{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_914.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"45bde76ba5c874142a6540af0880b1e15a61c6e5ea969334567630fed4a6b122","ja":"にゃはは。そんな、アタシたちだけで\n遊びに行く予定立てたりとか、するわけないじゃん！","zh":"哈哈。我们才不会只顾着自己计划去玩什么的嘛！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_914.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"3f50ef4c862a35ce50cb6aeafc7b800528a6e97b4cc1219d7593b56841bc6b29","ja":"みんなで翼をビックリさせようって思って、\nこっそりサプライズでプレゼントを用意してたんだ！","zh":"我们想让翼大吃一惊，所以偷偷准备了惊喜礼物！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_914.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"e7d501f483fb0fadc82c706d1417af52bccf032bb3a285669782c817c9ad9d9e","ja":"前回のツアーで、翼は立派にリーダーを務めあげて\nくれました。これは、私たちからの気持ちです。","zh":"在上次的巡演中，翼出色地完成了领队的职责。这是我们的一份心意。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_914.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"95deddcac367166fcbe52595d3925e2e695fc0bc673dbf3076cabfbd918d5544","ja":"翼ちゃんに喜んでもらいたくて、選んだのですよ！\n受け取ってもらえると、姫たちも嬉しいのです♪","zh":"为了让小翼开心，我特意挑选的哦！你愿意收下的话，公主们也会很开心的♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_914.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"c55f8f6f4f6a1a2754f2da7d9f58e3126afe6e9935b7d13b462e118abd54d799","ja":"恵美さん、貴音さん、まつりさん……。\nありがとうございます！","zh":"惠美、贵音、茉莉……  \n谢谢你们！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_914.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"c880d5eb9efe815409c575c4d4b91207d662a927d66d1071f5cc64d1e1636840","ja":"……でも、いいのかな？","zh":"……可是，这样真的好吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_914.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"bb858626690a36767813f4c57db25b2014c0f45c373bb511cebf8ddb9a3194c9","ja":"ほ？　なにがなのです？","zh":"咦？什么事呀？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_914.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"9a483bf444d6e73614f2b0b77c9b2720674b5eeb167c93073e389f3308d374db","ja":"だって、わたしが最後までリーダーをやれたのは、\nみんなのおかげです！　それなのに……。","zh":"因为我能一直担任队长到最后，都是多亏了大家！可是……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_914.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"19f5c818d43dc967b98f69dcc9e5afb497f858c579221d5e017466d74b6589ec","ja":"翼ちゃん、ユニットが大成功したのは、\nリーダーのおかげなのですよ。","zh":"翼，多亏了队长，这个组合才能大获成功。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_914.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"b9e7dde6e3edcc2d10266f4cd21c33df02d3113b42e8d5a2e5a21a4edf124086","ja":"それに、至らないところがあれば、支え合えば\nいいのです。姫たちは、ユニットなのですから。","zh":"而且，如果有做得不够好的地方，互相支持就好了。毕竟我们可是一个组合。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_914.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"72efb25d398a6c41b523c62958984d54cedeef3bcf856619494502a4ba5643b6","ja":"まつりさん……。わたし、このユニットで\n一緒に活動ができて、本当によかったです！","zh":"真莉……我能和你一起在这个组合里活动，真的太好了！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_914.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"98dcd2439b7613118a6f46d23fff08e8de72b9df1d805456c103c0f716a5bc22","ja":"次は絶対、わたしが\nみんなにサプライズでお返ししますね♪","zh":"下次我一定要给大家一个惊喜作为回礼♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_914.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"bfadd7690a0214afa0ec92661e190078d4c13f2d7269ef902e54265664040da4","ja":"ふふっ、楽しみにしているのです。でも……\n予告しちゃったら、サプライズにはならないのですよ？","zh":"呵呵，我很期待哦。不过……\n要是提前预告了，就不能算惊喜了吧？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
